<title>FINLAND: Finnish June GDP rises 2.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish June GDP rises 2.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 2.4 percent year-on-year in June, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.4 percent in June on May, SF said.  </p>
<p>			  June 1996	May 1996	 June 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +2.4 pct	 +2.3 pct	 +3.3 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.4 pct	 +0.3 pct	 +/-0 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
